{"availability":"available","full":"Cezart3/KiraImobiliare","name":"KiraImobiliare","description":"Romanian rental aggregator - scraping worker + FastAPI + React. Filters source sites don't have (own-boiler vs district heating, parking matching)","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-12T23:10:11Z","updated":"2026-08-18T19:44:14Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://kira-demo-gold.vercel.app","topics":["fastapi","full-stack","python","react","rest-api","sqlalchemy","stripe","tailwindcss","typescript","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://kira-demo-gold.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:45.589Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:45.589Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:45.589Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:54:45.589Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kira pulls rental listings from many Romanian real-estate sites (Storia, OLX, Imobiliare, Publi24, Lajumate and others) into one place, with filters the source sites don't offer:","It runs 100% locally — free, no account, no payment. Your data stays on your machine and every card links back to the original ad on the source site.","🔎 Want to see the interface first? kira-imobiliare.vercel.app — a public demo in which every listing is invented. It runs the real application over generated ad text: same API, same extractors, same parking matching. Nothing there was scraped, and scraping is disabled on it. Real listings only come from running it yourself, which is what the tool is for."],"features":["own gas boiler vs. district heating — classified automatically from the ad's text","parking included vs. a rentable parking spot nearby (with walking distance)","walking distance from your own address (e.g. your university) to each listing + a Google Maps link"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Cezart3/KiraImobiliare/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"